REM welcome.duck [MILD] - opens Notepad and types a friendly intro. Harmless.
REM Windows (Win+R). mac/Linux: open any text editor and focus it, then the
REM STRINGLN lines below will type into it.
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN notepad
DELAY 1800
DEFAULTDELAY 10
STRINGLN Hi! A Raspberry Pi pretending to be a USB keyboard typed this.
ENTER
STRINGLN This is the BadHID lab tool. It only types what it's told to.
STRINGLN Nothing here changed your computer - close without saving.
ENTER
STRINGLN  - BadHID (the legal kind of hacking)
